      "SecondaryAttribute": "faithfulness_card_1cea533a839c56ee1f62c956__openai_gpt-6_1-sol",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<strong>Paragraph</strong><br><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap\">Causes and forms of sexist hate speech\n\nSexist hate speech is one of the expressions of sexism, which can be defined as any supposition, belief, assertion, gesture or act that is aimed at expressing contempt towards a person, based on her or his sex or gender, or to consider that person as inferior or essentially reduced to her or his sexual dimension. Sexist hate speech includes expressions which spread, incite, promote or justify hatred based on sex. The true extent of sexist hate speech is partly hidden by the fact that many targeted women do not report it.\n\nPrevalence of sexual harassment among women (%, European Union, 2014)\n</div><table><tr><th>Period</th><th>Prevalence (%)</th></tr>\n<tr><th>In the last 12 months</th><td>21</td></tr>\n<tr><th>Since the age of 15</th><td>55</td></tr></table><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap\">\nSexist hate speech takes many forms both online and offline, notably victim blaming and re-victimisation; “slut-shaming”; body-shaming; “revenge porn” (the sharing of explicit or sexual images without consent); brutal and sexualised threats of death, rape and violence; offensive comments on appearance, sexuality, sexual orientation or gender roles; but also false compliments or supposed jokes, using humour to humiliate and ridicule the target.</div><br><strong>Argument</strong><br><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap\">Sexist hate speech includes expressions that spread, incite, promote or justify hatred based on sex, within a broader pattern of contempt and treatment of people as inferior or reduced to their sexual dimension. Its online and offline forms include victim blaming, re-victimisation, non-consensual sharing of sexual images, and brutal and sexualised threats of death, rape and violence. Its true extent is partly hidden because targeted women may not report it.</div><br><strong>How relevant is the argument to the paragraph?</strong>",
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataExportTag": "faithfulness_card_1cea533a839c56ee1f62c956__openai_gpt-6_1-sol",
