    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_9Kzg3KA9F3QnEFM",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID74",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "faithfulness_card_0c64d2ec28127122def1b3be__deepseek_deepseek-v4_1-flash-1017",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<strong>Paragraph</strong><br><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap\">Combating Sexist Hate Speech\n\nCouncil of Europe\nGender Equality Strategy\n\nSexist hate speech is rampant in Europe and women are disproportionately targeted. Sexist hate speech takes place online and offline and in all forms of social interaction: at school, in the family, in social circles, in the public space, at work, via emails, websites and (social) media. Although it has taken a new dimension through the Internet, the root causes of sexist hate speech preceded the technology and are fundamentally linked to the persistent unequal power relations between women and men. Sexist hate speech is a form of violence against women and girls that perpetuates and exacerbates gender inequality. Both knowledge and policy action at all levels need to be developed to combat sexist hate speech.\n\nThe Council of Europe’s Gender Equality Strategy 2014-2017 explicitly includes tackling sexism as a form of hate speech under its strategic objective 1 – combating gender stereotypes and sexism.</div><br><strong>Argument</strong><br><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap\">Sexist hate speech is a form of violence against women and girls that perpetuates and exacerbates gender inequality. It occurs online and offline across schools, families, social circles, public space, work, emails, websites, and social media, and its root causes are linked to persistent unequal power relations between women and men. Combating it requires knowledge and policy action at all levels, including gender equality strategies that treat sexism as a form of hate speech.</div><br><strong>How relevant is the argument to the paragraph?</strong>",
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataExportTag": "faithfulness_card_0c64d2ec28127122def1b3be__deepseek_deepseek-v4_1-flash-1017",
